rn.nyu.edu/experience-stern/news-events/new-research-finds-special-interest-lobbying-does-influence-nih-research-funding","target":"https://www.stern.nyu.edu/experience-stern/news-events/new-research-finds-special-interest-lobbying-does-influence-nih-research-funding","line":1435},{"title":"https://www.bizjournals.com/baltimore/news/2019/07/26/the-10-largest-private-sector-employers-in-greater.html","target":"https://www.bizjournals.com/baltimore/news/2019/07/26/the-10-largest-private-sector-employers-in-greater.html","line":1437},{"title":"http://www.laalmanac.com/employment/em21e.php","target":"http://www.laalmanac.com/employment/em21e.php","line":1439},{"title":"https://www.fredhutch.org/en/about.html","target":"https://www.fredhutch.org/en/about.html","line":1441},{"title":"https://www.rti.org/about-us","target":"https://www.rti.org/about-us","line":1443},{"title":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK190605/","target":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK190605/","line":1445}],"metadata":{"title":"New Science's Report on the NIH","source":"https://newscience.org/nih/","author":null,"published":null,"created":"2026-04-24","description":"Introduction In 2006, the National Institutes of Health Reform Act passed Congress. 1 This droll, political document established a Scientific Management Review Board within the NIH. That board — comprised of Dr. Anthony Fauci, a former Lockheed Martin CEO and high-ranking NIH officials — was tasked with issuing recommendations for NIH reform; a noble and useful purpose.The board has not held a meeting since July 2015 and has written just eight reports in total, all of them between …","tags":["#clippings"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"resrc/clippings/New Science's Report on the NIH.md"},
